  "title": "Bamieh (Middle Eastern Okra Stew)",
  "description": "Lamb and okra are simmered in a fragrant, and spicy tomato-based broth. It's a Yemeni version of bamieh or okra stew.",
  "authors": [
    "E A Bowes"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:49:42-04:00",
